cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this project, please cite it as below. If you use the underlying TikTok
  dataset, please also see data/README.md for how to cite the original source.
title: "Personalized Analysis of Content Creator Performance with Explainable ML"
abstract: >-
  A semester project for the "Artificial Intelligence" course at the Ukrainian Catholic
  University. Compares per-creator and global Random Forest / XGBoost models for
  predicting TikTok video performance, with SHAP explanations of the predictions.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-17"
type: software
